[Music]  audrey has changed a lot since we first  saw her flash her picture-perfect smile  across the screen but not exactly in a  good way will she turn out to be as  wicked as Hades in uma for her will she  somehow give them both a run for their  money  we'll find out soon enough but for now  let's find out who Audrey really is and  what her motives are  when it comes to wanting to be the  fairest of them all Audrey puts the evil  queen to shame  Audrey's the daughter of Prince Phillip  and Princess Aurora who are the  protagonists of the classic Disney movie  Sleeping Beauty Audrey was raised to be  a little Miss Perfect she was given the  most beautiful gowns praised by her  grandmother and given a place in the  spotlight to say that Audrey got used to  being the queen bee would be an  understatement  so whenever Audrey's title gets  challenged she does her best to  eliminate the competition when we first  meet Audrey at the beginning of  descendants it's clear that she's not  happy to be meeting the vks welcome to  our dime trev not only is the daughter  of her mother's mortal enemy now  attending auradon prep but her boyfriend  Ben is totally smitten by her Audrey  doesn't miss a beat and she's quick to  point out that the VIII case have been  stripped of their royal titles within  ten seconds of meeting Audrey it's  obvious that she's got a hidden agenda a  purse leave dating the future king of  auradon is a pretty big deal especially  since it means that you might one day be  queen by now we all know that Audrey was  determined to be crowned the official  ruler of the United States of auradon  however her plans came crashing down  when Ben dumped her after winning a  tourney match and declared his love for  mal instead of dealing with her emotions  Audrey chose to keep up with appearances  so she immediately started dating Chad  charming to get back at then which um  didn't work to say the least  Audrey's attitude is rotten to the core  she's extremely vain and won't hesitate  to throw someone under the bus as long  as it makes her look good instead of  being happy for her best friends Lonnie  and Jane after mal gave them gorgeous  makeovers Audrey was totally fuming  turns out Audrey doesn't want anyone  looking better than her especially not  her friends  Audrey is so used to being the center of  attention that she's willing to claw her  way into the spotlight  before Melanie be transferred to auradon  prep Audrey was the girl everyone wanted  to be however things quickly changed  when the fashionable Evie and the  gorgeous Mouse started giving her a  title a run for its money there's no  doubt about it  Audrey is a beautiful girl she has  magnificent hair a killer smile amazing  skin and she looks pretty in pink but  the fact that she feels threatened by  Mouse presence just goes to show how  insecure she really is  it looks like audrey has some growing up  to do but whether she chooses to take  the high road is solely up to her with  the way things ended in the first  descendants film we were under the  impression that Audrey had learned to  accept the vks after proving themselves  to be good people mal edj and Carlos  were welcomed into Oregon with open arms  instead of being jealous  Audrey seemed to be on board she was  showcased dancing and singing along to  the set it off musical number with a  huge smile on her face so it appeared as  though Audrey had denounced her  holier-than-thou attitude and made peace  with mal and Ben however it's possible  that Audrey was just embracing the  spotlight before returning to her old  devices Audrey doesn't make an  appearance in descendants - however  she's mentioned quite a lot we find out  through Jane that Audrey is at a spa  retreat with flora fauna and  Merryweather and it's soon revealed that  Chad was dumped by Audrey soon after the  events of the first descendants film  transpired it turns out that Audrey  wasn't really into Chad she just wanted  to make Ben Jealous which isn't exactly  news whether Audrey was truly out of spa  is up for debate but we wouldn't put it  past her to be cooking up a master plan  it's no secret that Chad's got it bad  for Audrey she's the girl of his dreams  and according to Audrey he can keep on  dreaming Chad made it painfully clear  that Audrey isn't into him because his  name is Prince Chad not King Chad and  that title makes all the difference this  tidbit of information is pretty  essential because it confirms that  Audrey doesn't really love Ben she loves  what he could have offered her Audrey  wants to be the queen and she'll stop at  nothing to make her own dreams come true  but what is she really up to one look at  Audrey is all you need to know that that  girl's got something brewing in the  darkest corners of her mind before the V  case came to auradon audrey was the  prettiest and the most popular the most  envied and the most likely to succeed  but the captain of the cheerleading  squad just couldn't hold her titles and  it's quite possible that being dumped by  then in front of the entire school  seriously bruised her inflated ego so  what do villains do when they've been  scorned they get even or take things up  a notch  that's what at the end of descendants  Chadd receives a distress call from  Audrey right before the cotillion begins  it's a distress call and chat is more  than willing to be Audrey's knight in  shining armor so instead of going to the  cotillion  Chad heads towards the Sherwood Forest  to help Audrey with her car troubles but  whether or not  Audrey's distress call was staged is a  question many descendants fans have  asked themselves descendants three is  slated to air in the summer of 2019 and  it looks like Audrey might just be  playing the villain pictures of an evil  looking Audrey and a terrified Chad have  been circulating the internet and it  looks as though audrey has a very wicked  plan up her sleeve  Audrey's delicate look has been replaced  with a much edgier vibe she's seen  holding Maleficent sceptre while wearing  the missing crown so it's quite possible  that Audrey's the one who stole these  items from the Museum of cultural  history audrey has always had a mean  streak about her she was raised under  the premise that she was better than  everyone especially the vks so the fact  that she was vested by mal totally  messed with her mind we just hope she'll  have the good sense to let bygones be  bygones  before she winds up being the queen of  the Isle of the Lost  so do you guys think Audrey is rotten to  the core or is she simply going through  a rough patch in her life let us know in  the comments section below  and that's a wrap thanks for watching  the things we hope you liked our video  give it a big thumbs up if you're  excited for descendant 3 for the latest  descendants news be sure to hit that  subscribe button we'll see you next time  [Music]

